*E_NAME		"Mixing Craftsman, Morald"

*E_CHAT		"What is the purpose of Mixture?     Well, you can maximize the capacity of equipments through one-time      reinforcement. It's much better thanAging since the items can be break  during imperfect reinforcement."
*E_CHAT		"Mixture is not only highly-developedtechnology but also the safest way  to upgrade equipment."
*E_CHAT		"Mixing basically differs from Aging system with which you can lose the  items during reinforcement." 
*E_CHAT		"Mixture system was introduced a few of millenniums ago and yet only halfof the system has been discovered."